### Variables

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = postman-customer
@idempotencyKey = postman-order-test-002
@orderId = adb12d90-e964-42ca-b23e-622bb723f9b1

### 1. Health Check

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Readiness Check

GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### 3. Create Order

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "customer_id": "{{customerId}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "product-test",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. List Orders

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/

### 5. Get Order by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### 6. Confirm Payment

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm-payment

### 7. Get Order Timeline

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/timeline
